-- A database at PRAGMA user_version 16 (venue-rig-fixes plan step 16), from before surface jobs
-- (surface-setup plan session 5): its channel strips are binding rows at strip ids. Project 1, "Rig
-- session", has on both layers groups front, back and sides on strips 1, 2 and 4 (strip 3 empty), the
-- fixture hex-1 on strip 5 and the group front on the master strip; on layer A the fixture hex-2 on
-- strip 1; on layer B a row at strip 3 this build cannot read; beside them its own select on button
-- 29 (strip 5's select button) and a blackout on button 3. Project 2, "Second show", has the
-- fixtures spot-1 and spot-2 on strips 1 and 2. Strip 2 holds a takeover policy. Its schema is a
-- step-16 desk's, which is step 15's: step 16 changed no table.
-- Frozen: never regenerate it from a later commit.

